'''Dimension of Delirium''' is a set of special stages that was added in [[Version 8.2 Update|Version 8.2]] and appears every Thursday. The first stage yields 1 million XP when first completed, while the second stage drops the [[True Form]] of [[Drumcorps Cat (Rare Cat)|Drumcorps Cat]]: Mochi Cat.

